{"1237320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sonic Frontiers", "steam_appid": 1237320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2089730, 2089733, 2089840], "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p></p><br><h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/1e2d15645a868eb097cd431252e475fc.avif?t=1783493175\" width=600 height=260 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPERIENCE SONIC LIKE NEVER BEFORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In search of the missing Chaos Emeralds, Sonic becomes stranded on an ancient island teeming with unusual creatures. Accelerate to new heights and explore vast open zones as you race across the massive Starfall Islands! Battle hordes of powerful enemies with an action-packed combat system, uncover the island's mysteries, and save Sonic's Friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Comprehensive Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Sonic's latest 3D adventure, featuring all game mode and content updates in one package. Beyond Sonic, play also as Tails, Amy, and Knuckles, each with their own unique abilities and fighting styles, in the &quot;Final Horizon&quot; Campaign. Enjoy bonus challenges, costumes, music, and much more via the &quot;Sonic's Birthday Bash&quot; and &quot;Sights, Sound, and Speed&quot; Content Updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/babcd5e37af47260a9ea49cdeefa3234.poster.avif?t=1783493175\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/babcd5e37af47260a9ea49cdeefa3234.webm?t=1783493175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/babcd5e37af47260a9ea49cdeefa3234.mp4?t=1783493175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3D Open Zone Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become Sonic and journey to uncover the mysteries of the remains of an ancient civilization plagued by robotic hordes. Race across five massive overworlds islands - each, a unique action-platforming challenge and loaded with hidden secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/83c8d5d9e3d15e8c8f031098b2d07813.poster.avif?t=1783493175\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/83c8d5d9e3d15e8c8f031098b2d07813.webm?t=1783493175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/83c8d5d9e3d15e8c8f031098b2d07813.mp4?t=1783493175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Action-Packed Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine moves such as dodges, parries, counters, and combos with a battle system and set of skill tree upgrades that allow you to fight more strategically than ever before. Against mysterious foes and colossal titans, use the new Cyloop ability to take them down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/0d08c9f9352472c3ed4a4f7c48f01568.poster.avif?t=1783493175\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/0d08c9f9352472c3ed4a4f7c48f01568.webm?t=1783493175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/0d08c9f9352472c3ed4a4f7c48f01568.mp4?t=1783493175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Bonus Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get even more out of the entire Sonic Frontiers experience through previously released* bonus content: Explorer's Treasure Box, &quot;Monster Hunter&quot; Collaboration Pack, &quot;Sonic Adventure 2&quot; Shoes, Holiday Cheer Suit, and a special Digital Art Book and Mini Soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/323a17a3b3e1f19bc0ade7958f6a7b12.poster.avif?t=1783493175\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/323a17a3b3e1f19bc0ade7958f6a7b12.webm?t=1783493175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/323a17a3b3e1f19bc0ade7958f6a7b12.mp4?t=1783493175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Adventurer’s Treasure Box not included.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPERIENCE SONIC LIKE NEVER BEFORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In search of the missing Chaos Emeralds, Sonic becomes stranded on an ancient island teeming with unusual creatures. Accelerate to new heights and explore vast open zones as you race across the massive Starfall Islands! Battle hordes of powerful enemies with an action-packed combat system, uncover the island's mysteries, and save Sonic's Friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Comprehensive Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Sonic's latest 3D adventure, featuring all game mode and content updates in one package. Beyond Sonic, play also as Tails, Amy, and Knuckles, each with their own unique abilities and fighting styles, in the &quot;Final Horizon&quot; Campaign. Enjoy bonus challenges, costumes, music, and much more via the &quot;Sonic's Birthday Bash&quot; and &quot;Sights, Sound, and Speed&quot; Content Updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/babcd5e37af47260a9ea49cdeefa3234.poster.avif?t=1783493175\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/babcd5e37af47260a9ea49cdeefa3234.webm?t=1783493175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/babcd5e37af47260a9ea49cdeefa3234.mp4?t=1783493175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3D Open Zone Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become Sonic and journey to uncover the mysteries of the remains of an ancient civilization plagued by robotic hordes. Race across five massive overworlds islands - each, a unique action-platforming challenge and loaded with hidden secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/83c8d5d9e3d15e8c8f031098b2d07813.poster.avif?t=1783493175\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/83c8d5d9e3d15e8c8f031098b2d07813.webm?t=1783493175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/83c8d5d9e3d15e8c8f031098b2d07813.mp4?t=1783493175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Action-Packed Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine moves such as dodges, parries, counters, and combos with a battle system and set of skill tree upgrades that allow you to fight more strategically than ever before. Against mysterious foes and colossal titans, use the new Cyloop ability to take them down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/0d08c9f9352472c3ed4a4f7c48f01568.poster.avif?t=1783493175\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/0d08c9f9352472c3ed4a4f7c48f01568.webm?t=1783493175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/0d08c9f9352472c3ed4a4f7c48f01568.mp4?t=1783493175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Bonus Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get even more out of the entire Sonic Frontiers experience through previously released* bonus content: Explorer's Treasure Box, &quot;Monster Hunter&quot; Collaboration Pack, &quot;Sonic Adventure 2&quot; Shoes, Holiday Cheer Suit, and a special Digital Art Book and Mini Soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/323a17a3b3e1f19bc0ade7958f6a7b12.poster.avif?t=1783493175\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/323a17a3b3e1f19bc0ade7958f6a7b12.webm?t=1783493175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/extras/323a17a3b3e1f19bc0ade7958f6a7b12.mp4?t=1783493175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Adventurer’s Treasure Box not included.</p>", "short_description": "Sonic Frontiers is a groundbreaking open-zone action-adventure game set on the ancient Starfall Islands. Join Sonic as he battles hordes of powerful enemies with an all-new combat system, explores the mysteries of the islands, and saves his friends!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/header.jpg?t=1783493175", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783493175", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237320/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783493175", "website": "https://frontiers.sonicthehedgehog.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3470 or AMD Ryzen 5 1400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660, 2 GB or AMD Radeon HD 7870, 2 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 720p Low @ 30 FPS. Requires a CPU which supports the AVX and SSE4 instruction set. Microsoft no longer supports Windows 10 or older versions</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</st